  "prefLabel": "En 608.01 Safety Instructions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 608.01 Safety Instructions.\n\n(a) Each water utility shall adopt comprehensive instructions for the safety of employees regarding the operation, construction, and maintenance of its plant facilities.\n\n(b) Each water utility shall require that such employees have been properly informed of safe practices and are cognizant of all hazards involved.\n\nSource. #13911, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 600)",
